TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium in pure water, open to O2, allow goethite+gypsum
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite  0     0.1
    Goethite 0    0
    Gypsum   0    0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -molalities H+
END
